      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. it's just that \"valid\" doesn't mean it doesn't hurt. it feels like i'm looking at a person in the mirror but there's nothing actually behind the eyes. it's just... empty. like the person i was actually died when he left, and now i'm just an outline. do you think it's possible to just be nothing?",
